IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `msa-liability`

-- Merchant Shipping Act 1995, Part 8 (ss 135-138, First Schedule Arts 1-4, 6, 7), ss 98, 102, 106, 107, 153, 156, 157, 159 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_merchant-shipping-act-1995.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Part 8 -- who may limit`

#ASSERT `the person may invoke limitation` `the registered owner` TRUE
