#ASSERT `the person may invoke limitation` `an operator` TRUE
#ASSERT `the person may invoke limitation` `a salvor` TRUE
#ASSERT `the person may invoke limitation` `a liability insurer` TRUE
#ASSERT `the person may invoke limitation` `the master or a crew member` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the person may invoke limitation` `the owner of the cargo` TRUE
#ASSERT `the person may invoke limitation` `a charterer` FALSE
#ASSERT `the person may invoke limitation` `the registered owner` FALSE

